<conbody class="- topic/body  concept/conbody ">
<p class="- topic/p ">The system supports three password features designed to strengthen
access security:</p>
<ul class="- topic/ul ">
<li class="- topic/li "><p class="- topic/p ">Password strength that may be configured for each authentication
scheme.</p></li>
<li class="- topic/li "><p class="- topic/p ">An expiration interval for a password</p></li>
<li class="- topic/li "><p class="- topic/p ">Password history</p></li>
</ul>
